{"title":"Ore Order","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Wanted: ten iron ore for the smiths. There&#39;s plenty in the Iron Mine northeast of town. You&#39;ll find me at the blacksmith stall east of the tavern. (The Mining Trainer)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><span class=\"muted\">unknown</span></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/iron-ore\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bffa864aa99d4c870949.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Ore</a> <b>×10</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to the quest-giver to get the quest.</li><li value=\"2\">Bring 10 iron ore to the Mining Trainer in Binxonia <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/iron-ore\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bffa864aa99d4c870949.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Ore</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 29, -23</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"29|-23|Bring 10 iron ore to the Mining Trainer in Binxonia\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>350</td></tr><tr><td>Mining XP</td><td>150</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Ore Order</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-ore-order\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-ore-order\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-ore-order\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-ore-order\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}